ADDITIONAL USAGE RESTRICTIONS (Until Paper Acceptance):

While this software is released under the MIT License, we request that users
respect the following restrictions until our paper is accepted for publication:

1. You MAY use this code for research, education, and evaluation purposes.
2. You MAY cite our work in your academic papers.
3. You SHOULD NOT use this code as a baseline in submissions to conferences
   or journals before our paper is accepted.
4. You SHOULD NOT re-train or modify the method for publication before the
   full training code is released.

These additional restrictions are voluntary and will be removed when the
complete codebase is released upon paper acceptance.
